
# 2018 PbPb QCDPhoton Configuration

# Processing Control
Verbose 1
FileLimit 99999
FilesPerOutput 10
BatchMode 1

# I/O Configuration
InputDir /eos/cms/store/group/phys_heavyions/bharikri/LLR_BACKUP/PbPb/Pythia8_NOMINAL/
OutputDir /eos/cms/store/group/phys_heavyions/bharikri/Run3GammaJet/2025_10_28/2018_PbPb/MC/
OutName 2025_10_28_QCDPhoton_2018_pthat_combined_skimmed

Trees hiEvtAnalyzer/HiTree:hiEvt ggHiNtuplizerGED/EventTree:ggHi skimanalysis/HltTree:skim hltanalysis/HltTree:hlt akCs2PFJetAnalyzer_substructure/t:AK2Z2 akCs3PFJetAnalyzer_substructure/t:AK3Z2 akCs4PFJetAnalyzer_substructure/t:AK4Z2

